  "wikitext": "{{PageDisplay}}\n[[File:Porridge Bar.png|left|239x239px|Porridge Bar]]\n{{Infobox\n |title = [[Production Buildings|Machine]]\n |level = 119\n |price = 1,300,000\n |time = 4 d\n |slots = 2\n |xp = 44\n |dia = 89\n |size = 2×2\n}}\nThe '''Porridge Bar''' is a [[Production Buildings|production building]] unlocked at [[experience]] level 119. It was added in the September 2023 update.\n\nIt is used to make [[Apple Porridge]], [[Sweet Porridge]] and [[Fresh Porridge]].\n\n{{Clr}}\n----\n==='''Appearance'''===\nThe machine's appearance is a filled Porridge Pot placed on a wooden terracotta kitchen with a red curtain on the top, and a fireplace below to heat up the Porridge. It is surrounded with a container of milk and cream behind, tray filled with apples, and some ceramic bowls. There is also a small light blue stool in the side of the kitchen. \n\nThe mastered version of this machine has the curtain's color changed to golden yellow, and a star on top of the wooden decoration, while some golden parts in the handle of the Pot. \n{{Clr}}\n----\n=== '''Building''' ===\nIt costs 1,300,000 {{Infoicon|coin}} and takes 4 days (or 89 {{Infoicon|dia}}) to build the Porridge Bar. It gives players 44 {{Infoicon|xp}} when completed.\n{{Clr}}\n----\n=== '''Products''' ===\n{{Building Products\n|Apple Porridge|119|20m|522\n|Sweet Porridge|120|45m|460\n|Fresh Porridge|122|35m|435\n}}\n{{Clr}}\n----\n=== '''Upgrading''' ===\n{{Main|Production Buildings}}\nThe Porridge Bar originally has two slots available. Unlocking the third slot costs 6 [[diamond]]s. Players can unlock 7 new slots in total, each new one costing 3 more {{Infoicon|dia}} than the previous one.\n{{Clr}}\n----\n=== '''Mastering''' ===\nA total of 2,180 hours of production is required to [[Masteries|master]] the Porridge Bar:\n{| border=\"0\" cellpadding=\"2\" cellspacing=\"1\" style=\"text-align: center; margin: 1em 0; border-collapse: collapse;\"\n|-\n|rowspan=\"3\"|[[File:Porridge Bar Mastered.png|150px|Mastered Porridge Bar]]\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\"|'''★<br />140 hrs'''\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\"|'''★★<br />410 hrs'''\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\"|'''★★★<br />1,630 hrs'''\n|-\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb;\"|[[File:TruckM10Coins.png|100px]]\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb;\"|[[File:TruckM5XP.png|100px|]]\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb;\"|[[File:Porridge Bar Mastery.png|100px]]\n|-\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\"|'''<span title=\"10% more coins for truck orders\">+10% {{Infoicon|coin}}</span>'''\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\"|'''<span title=\"5% more experience points for truck orders\">+5% {{Infoicon|xp}}</span>'''\n|style =\"border: 1px solid #bbb; background: #ddd;\"|'''15% faster'''\n|}\n{{Clr}}\n----\n=== '''Strategy tips''' ===\n•[[Sweet Porridge]] has the longest time production in this machine, over 45 minutes. You can use this product in production to master the machine.{{Clr}}\n----\n{{Navigation}}\n{{Languages\n|de = Haferbreitheke\n|es = Puesto de gachas\n|it = Pentolone del porridge\n|no = Grøtbod\n|ru = Кашеварня\n}}\n[[pt-br:Barraca do mingau]]\n\n[[Category:Production Buildings]]",
  "wikitextHash": "bf106bbd9fd6e76747ec4fdc6245d35c4625c82358dbdad34e249716e9ad8d08"
